  "notes": "Method (forked from mexicat/pdoom-video's analysis/ pipeline; adapted for this song, see analysis/README-whatif.md): (1) CTC emissions (20 ms frames) of the Demucs vocal stem from two acoustic models, torchaudio MMS_FA and wav2vec2-large-lv60k-960h, each on the mono sum and on the left and right channels, fused as a probability mixture; (2) one global constrained Viterbi forced alignment of all 13 lines over the whole song with a garbage 'star' token between lines to absorb instrumental gaps and backing vocals, constrained per line to a rough time window from the whisper.cpp mix reference; (3) signal refinement per word on the vocal stem: start moved to the voice re-entry after a rest, snapped to the nearest spectral-flux onset, or moved back to the start of s/sh/ch/f/th frication; ends = next word start when legato, else when the voice drops 15 dB below the word level; (4) cross-check against whisper.cpp (large-v3) word timestamps on the vocal stem and the individual models/channels. conf: 0.35 + agreement of the independent alignments (<=60 ms) + CTC posterior + whisper agreement; manual fixes carry their own conf."
